{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4e82b99eea7f379e5d9b27ddbbea96abd6a3007ce00b429e1f9fb3518851c1fc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_73da4fb4f56d74f8e0a2ad654d6529fcc7d43a717c76ce7d4af50913789c1753","slc_ad96ee007a79296d15107fdda9befe04d1d94828e077046563c0456486a6b420","slc_c8e15b5b3e1c4f88527507d60215708eebe92e133b80590cce8e4366df49ea3d"],"source_ids":["src_c66a465232cd5868b16aae0fcc6fbce3"],"text":"Repository development practice: optional Cursor integration tests are build-tagged, run via go test -tags=cursor_integration, and are intended for local/dev environments rather than CI.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_503e285b1c2946cadebdc933aec798870296aca511fa21ad49d1fd537a77bbe9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_63d1280f7ca6bd29690b470a4e547caba519028fca79078bc01b30e59ea9a635"],"source_ids":["src_c66a465232cd5868b16aae0fcc6fbce3"],"text":"Since Cursor lacks --append-system-prompt, Perles prepends the system prompt to the main prompt with a blank line separator, the same approach used for OpenCode.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5487d2c58aa59d90888259336c8f2d28a0b823d8d2dc14049b98e1503155f97a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a3bb2c56b2810aa9a45c1ca6366435c95f839f6fc25ce4c2c704dbcd528dfc17"],"source_ids":["src_c66a465232cd5868b16aae0fcc6fbce3"],"text":"Cursor CLI does not support tool filtering flags, so all agent tools remain enabled and the DisallowedTools config field is silently ignored for that provider.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5d91c901528c90de287e78daa34aa3331a8792b2089765c9fdacf0a3b4017b6b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cba0a49c47372cf48df1ecebdc6cde29c1f298f8a728edcf7aa1a6bb09779ac3"],"source_ids":["src_f1823368b9415eb19acdd355f293ed82"],"text":"Global keybindings include ctrl+space to switch between Kanban and Search modes, ctrl+o to enter Orchestration/Dashboard mode, ? for help, and ctrl+c to quit.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5fe13e564fac56548fb95e11f15250fa0c114e1fee368ddd63877e69fa36a9ba","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1a00c71ee5acd57c43a73d22aaf380b0a7621da76cea367447d8d4573621524f","slc_88b875cfa9a0700aac5ed22e636d315a082e7a5d26f59b0ecc11a2fa074d1e5b"],"source_ids":["src_be142816e72d5667b391d6e6d023ac82"],"text":"Orchestration mode is a multi-agent control plane where a coordinator headless agent spawns, replaces, and retires worker agents via built-in MCP tools, with multiple workflows run in parallel.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_67d304b32d49e6d6804bf7e4cb1f997137ee6f9fc06767fee16450e420195454","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_31180ff6e6b4948aad801466b5c8780cb6f4eaef47bae844a9c0cbc8b856b8d2"],"source_ids":["src_d7b05f54faf259818e7716b86d78daab"],"text":"Perles is a terminal UI for beads issue tracking powered by a custom BQL query language supporting boolean search, date filters, dependency traversal, and custom kanban views.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_68f82f927b6499f0b63334cf5fb9d06e259ebd2f9fadd0c9a207804df49b0bc9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1bd45cccd6b461f8bc2a5f6a6510df62df5f82fcad75206c496ccccf1ca4d23e","slc_36322fbb5160ecd31abc1d1df192297b803df7248be08b43f0e368a540c7ec1c","slc_4c26549b8087b429cdc5dd5636b63346ca68db318941e88d31e81d78b86f9a33"],"source_ids":["src_be142816e72d5667b391d6e6d023ac82","src_c66a465232cd5868b16aae0fcc6fbce3"],"text":"Orchestration providers include Claude, Amp, Codex, OpenCode, and Cursor Agent CLI; coordinator and worker clients can be mixed, e.g. cursor coordinator with claude workers.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_76bf15a24d7e2c3d90352a377fd0f0cea1008b57ecc7460d6f62587266ad3307","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8772a8972ada47bbea4bc4ff9e156a7aa4077d4aacfdb3375e990bba3df4961c","slc_9a95cfd075804123c1f539631cc9bcdc5aafdbf718b9380d85c6c57457fe2afd"],"source_ids":["src_c66a465232cd5868b16aae0fcc6fbce3","src_f1823368b9415eb19acdd355f293ed82"],"text":"Using the Cursor provider requires the cursor-agent CLI on PATH; installing from source requires Go 1.27+.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9ef6f051824f29988f18b9657fd327695e71b43f41d44bdd19d0ad813380dd2f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7463df8ac94b9686063f03d033dcd26d05dff36eb6a9fae218e080d2ce374f62"],"source_ids":["src_d816d6bc61495da18a93db27f4337791"],"text":"The Control Plane supports multiple concurrent workflows with resource governance, health monitoring with stuck-workflow recovery, a dashboard TUI, and unified event aggregation.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ae865c03813fb4c44446b647af734672451ce92b2e72db0cc8bcf004ed8d52ac","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_87585b70f9bbfa2b7afabb592be1d7278accdacda5cf9ce0b940febafec78e04"],"source_ids":["src_c66a465232cd5868b16aae0fcc6fbce3"],"text":"With the Cursor provider, token and cost fields show zero because Cursor's stream-json output lacks usage and cost data.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b8fa05cd744f317cc191d5e3d32fc126c296dc3484d0b5ccb2aa0e1159a17183","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_16af92715eee5b02c1c82558bf7c9f2a6346336ffcd5a773b45115bddbd5d621"],"source_ids":["src_d816d6bc61495da18a93db27f4337791"],"text":"The dashboard TUI offers keyboard actions for navigating workflows, filtering, starting (s), pausing (p), stopping (x), creating (n/N), and opening detail views.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_bed82846bba2df1c454fe00cf07e28c8efc9a13835b6e95a60174f3bf6fd4678","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_05942bb1846bd3a09e1deca21ef60a3536c711a1241f2fcc557e35b7821fac6b","slc_b3f12a07273ecde973986132bee0877a91f2ec3edb567fa94d2d3cdbc7f7c497"],"source_ids":["src_d816d6bc61495da18a93db27f4337791"],"text":"Workflows move through states Pending, Running, Paused, Completed, Failed, and Stopped, with documented transitions including stop from pending, running, or paused.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c69dcfae9bab0606dc85417860b81d5ea2504fb44f3e4b8e46e463f2bac98f7a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0e8100b7adbb9f902a6bba5142242c22887faf1a4ff7287c43ffe9c1279c8eb0","slc_2eed5ee1ea4c67283b11bb6ee738e6b4ce67b83958c15b2dc0a24335b9fa23e6","slc_3ff7a1ad468219b6be7995250f5ccf827d7ddf2df554bfb5463b579e32f56466"],"source_ids":["src_d816d6bc61495da18a93db27f4337791"],"text":"Control Plane behavior is configured in ~/.config/perles/config.yaml under orchestration.control_plane, with resource policy defaults of 5 concurrent workflows, 10 workers, 5 AI calls, and MCP ports 9000-9100.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ca60a241d71e0e380f83af37ead67cdb5acd88eb87175b101011a3f1d88c8516","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_eb4681bca57357bf58ff8fc786a08f6b7ec2512b53670892c63241ae5c9ac2bc","slc_ec74d688d75517a493091ce5e22749a990788d167c7d2accf9798b64cc3f6a6a","slc_f80c13c88c5d86f6073f6833a1d25e6fa334c6dcceda0d30d262aea228f1c954","slc_fc0ce1010054f7f43882c8e872a254a8dfe34d02c71abf6a0175f426151ce5bc"],"source_ids":["src_c66a465232cd5868b16aae0fcc6fbce3"],"text":"Because Cursor reads MCP config only from .cursor/mcp.json, Perles writes role-specific server entries (orchestrator, per-worker, observer) into that shared file using a read-merge-write pattern.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d023e10be69a11ffa689e2a4c84458c13c638bd91e6f2155b7cf65ff86bebe59","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5bbf7a1227277dcef6e99a4948794ec19de387b11ec522a1ce1f9222ddfb13b6","slc_a4bca1f3b04f759547833dc6f29536910474faeac0051078070868d26f8b7d56"],"source_ids":["src_f1823368b9415eb19acdd355f293ed82"],"text":"The CLI supports flags including --beads-dir, --config, --version, --help, and --debug, plus subcommands: perles (TUI), themes, workflows, and playground.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_db79fa544a6d6824eec2af225c6372862eda6ef3abb381a67a65d57dfa95b1ab","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_63ae72dbd08605250eb9ef9e9962920c1a87c7a2fd281e462c556ca009ec5ae2"],"source_ids":["src_d816d6bc61495da18a93db27f4337791"],"text":"The Control Plane comprises ControlPlane (lifecycle entry point), Registry (in-memory workflow storage), Supervisor, ResourceScheduler, HealthMonitor, and CrossWorkflowEventBus.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e3d36677ff0027f70548783283f85b5471fa4b8a435b3ab55768dc95fc6f1347","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"zjrosen/perles@f97afa7a7c44 snapshot a14eba7bf0be77df","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0d315480d37b385c5863d4595505430c1fd3c6df57abc4872c3cc846b815bda7","slc_49e33b3370735c4bf615753db9c0ab9b756a86f457d8c1dce7e5274ae74dfaa7","slc_5657bc1cf240fa52b82b208d7bda409a50973e9d52576dea0575ff0c11d6e963","slc_63ae72dbd08605250eb9ef9e9962920c1a87c7a2fd281e462c556ca009ec5ae2","slc_78aaed3d1edbd0aa1044a3afbbe43d0ee3e50b48ac74e1ecb83503665d7105e1","slc_a9e6d21a5e3e9f2d788f66ef23de6cfbe2d0f0739f59c82c31c4ff767c8fa0a0"],"source_ids":["src_d816d6bc61495da18a93db27f4337791"],"text":"Workflow instances track identity, state, priority, labels, timestamps, runtime infrastructure/session/MCP port, token budget, and last heartbeat/progress times; the Registry stores them in memory.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
